= The Democratic Left Movement

Our party must decide how to turn the Left of Center movement into a broader democratic programme. We can organize around workers, small farmers and other people who earn their living through their own labour, while defending parliamentary democracy.

- @support: Support a broader Democratic Left movement.
- @decline: Keep our current approach.
- @easy_discard

@support
on-arrival: democratic_left_movement = 1; peoples_party_support += 3; left_kemalists_dissent -= 5

We support the movement and begin building support for a broader party programme.

@decline
on-arrival: democratic_left_movement = -1

We keep the current party programme.
